<title>UK: SOCCER-NORTHERN IRELAND AND ARMENIA DRAW 1-1.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NORTHERN IRELAND AND ARMENIA DRAW 1-1.</headline>
<text>
<p>BELFAST, Oct 5 (Reuer) - Northern Ireland and Armenia drew</p>
<p>1-1 (halftime 1-1) in a World Cup group nine qualifer on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Northern Ireland - Neil Lennon (30th min)</p>
<p>Armenia - Eric Adouyan (8th)</p>
</text>
